---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import TeamGrid from '../components/TeamGrid.astro';
import FollowCta from '../components/FollowCta.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="The Degen Emporium is a sticker brand with a cast of characters attached. This is the short version of how that happened."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <PageHeader name="about" title="About" />

    <p class="prose lede">
      A sticker company with a cast of characters attached, run by people who
      would rather draw than explain.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
      <span class="tag">Draft copy &mdash; approve before launch</span>
      <p>This page is written, not supplied. It is placeholder in the brand
      voice, meant to show the shape of the page rather than to be the final
      word on anything. Nothing on it should be taken as a statement of fact
      about the business.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose about-body">
      <h2>The short version</h2>

      <p>The Degen Emporium started the way most of these things start: somebody
      drew something to amuse five people, and then those five people wanted it
      on a laptop lid.</p>

      <p>Everything since has been the same loop. Draw the thing. Cut the thing.
      Find out it doesn't work at 55&nbsp;millimetres. Draw it again. There is
      no strategy underneath it, and we've stopped pretending to look for one.</p>

      <h2>What it actually is</h2>

      <p>A brand with a face on it, and then four more faces, because one was
      never going to be enough. The crew came before the company did — they were
      a running joke long before any of them ended up on vinyl — and the
      Emporium is mostly a machine for putting them on things.</p>

      <p>The rest is the boring, useful part: an art range drawn for dark
      surfaces, a list of projects with honest statuses on it, and a page for
      writing down what changed. That's the whole operation.</p>

      <h2>What it isn't</h2>

      <p>It isn't a research desk. It isn't a signal group. Nobody here will
      ever tell you what to do with your money, and if a page on this site ever
      starts sounding like it might, that page is a mistake and should be
      reported as one.</p>

      <p>We link a few things on the <a href="/links">Links</a> page because
      you'll run into them constantly out here. We link them. We don't explain
      them, rate them, or vouch for them.</p>

      <h2>The voice</h2>

      <p>Dry, short, and allergic to a press release. If a sentence sounds like
      it was written to be quoted back at us, it gets cut. We are a mechanic who
      hates marketing, which is an awkward thing to be when you run a shop.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>The crew</h2>
        <a href="/team">Full bios &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <TeamGrid compact />
    </section>

    <FollowCta />
  </div>
</Base>
